-- promotemod: the §13.24 module fixture (inline auto-promotion). The
-- module fwrites a "..." literal through an fd it is handed as DATA
-- (the fd-as-data pattern, §13.17: a module cannot mention Stdout —
-- its mention would mangle). The literal promotes to bytesBind Auto0,
-- an ordinary source atom, which mangles to Auto0_v2 — so a module's
-- promoted handles namespace like every other atom, and two modules
-- promoting the same literal cannot collide. Shape of fdwriter.lind.
Boot {
  (Go, fd, reply) : [fwrite fd "module-made"; lob reply (Done,)]
}
